{"3053950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dungeon Rampage Remastered","steam_appid":3053950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5413230,4444110,5413440,5413450,5413460,5413430],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage Remastered<\/i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or stand alone as you fight your way through monster-filled dungeons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now fully remastered, the game runs on a new rendering engine, with high resolution assets, controller support, over 100 Steam achievements, a new way for rampagers to hit even higher levels, a rebalanced experience without P2W, and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and play styles. Whether you prefer the Berserker’s brute force, the Vampire Hunter’s cunning traps, or the Pyromancer’s elemental mayhem, there’s a hero to unlock for every type of player.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1793730506\" width=720 height=229 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally with up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a pet to join you on the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=269 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated dungeons, there is endless replayability. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=468 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, Dungeon Rampage left its 8 million player base without a home. We’re restored and remastered the game and are modernizing the original experience as we are working on polishing and expanding the content.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage Remastered<\/i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or stand alone as you fight your way through monster-filled dungeons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now fully remastered, the game runs on a new rendering engine, with high resolution assets, controller support, over 100 Steam achievements, a new way for rampagers to hit even higher levels, a rebalanced experience without P2W, and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and play styles. Whether you prefer the Berserker’s brute force, the Vampire Hunter’s cunning traps, or the Pyromancer’s elemental mayhem, there’s a hero to unlock for every type of player.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1793730506\" width=720 height=229 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally with up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a pet to join you on the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=269 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated dungeons, there is endless replayability. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=468 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, Dungeon Rampage left its 8 million player base without a home. We’re restored and remastered the game and are modernizing the original experience as we are working on polishing and expanding the content.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1793730506\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/extras\/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1793730506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Battle your way to victory in this 1-4 player co-op hack-n-slash dungeon crawler completely remastered! Play as a dynamic cast of heroes slicing their way through dungeons, earning weapons and loot. Rampage past a gauntlet of enemies and destruction to end the evil Lord Dinglepus' reign!","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/eac09ebd91ad5af0c09404e715ea7672c2404120\/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1793730506","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/6df097f46491ae18dbb2867acb6be4cd49c2ee82\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1793730506","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3053950\/6df097f46491ae18dbb2867acb6be4cd49c2ee82\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1793730506","website":"https:\/\/dungeonrampage.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1050 or equivalent (2+ GiB of Video Ram)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 6 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 4 GiB of Video Ram<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Gamebreaking Studios"],"publishers":["Gamebreaking Studios"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1499,"final":974,"discount_percent":35,"initial_formatted":"$14.99","final_formatted":"$9.74"},"packages":[1085415],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Dungeon Rampage Remastered","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1085415,"perc